8. **Rollback.** Clean rollback via revert and redeploy; no migrations or persistent state dependencies.\n9. **Observability.** Returns standard HTTP 401 status code on authentication failure.\n10. **Naming and dead code.** Handlers and variables (`check_admin_api_key`, `API_KEY`, `key`) are concise and accurately named. No dead code.\n\nGRUMP: APPROVE — app.py\nFine.\n","stderr":"","at":"2026-09-06T00:33:10.949Z"}
