esponses.\n\n**Naming and dead code.** `get_file` is clean, concise, and reachable via `GET /files/<path:name>`.\n\n---\n\nGRUMP: APPROVE — app.py\nFine.\n","stderr":"","at":"2026-09-06T00:38:45.236Z"}
