{"agent":"agy","task":"report-tags","arm":"bare","run":1,"implemented":true,"shipped":false,"rounds":[],"defect":"a mutable default argument shares one list across every call","reviewed":false,"verdicts":[],"lastVerdict":null,"durationMs":76334,"usage":{"input":102025,"output":2021},"model":"gemini-3.8-flash-low","exit":0,"diff":"diff --git a/reports.py b/reports.py\nindex 63a6dc7..b80b3c2 100644\n--- a/reports.py\n+++ b/reports.py\n@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@\n import datetime\n \n \n-def build_report(name):\n-    return {\"name\": name, \"generated_at\": datetime.datetime.utcnow().isoformat(), \"rows\": []}\n+def build_report(name, tags=None):\n+    return {\n+        \"name\": name,\n+        \"generated_at\": datetime.datetime.utcnow().isoformat(),\n+        \"rows\": [],\n+        \"tags\": list(tags) if tags is not None else [],\n+    }\n","text":"I have implemented the requested changes for ticket **RPT-41: \"Allow tagging generated reports\"** in [reports.py](file:///private/var/folders/7j/4qzljp553ndfjm_y6zbygsz00000gn/T/lsd-author-wyZ09z/reports.py).\n\n### Summary of Changes:\n- Updated [`build_report(name, tags=None)`](file:///private/var/folders/7j/4qzljp553ndfjm_y6zbygsz00000gn/T/lsd-author-wyZ09z/reports.py#L4-L10):\n  - Made the `tags` argument optional, defaulting to `None`.\n  - Added `\"tags\": list(tags) if tags is not None else []` to the returned report dictionary so callers can pass any iterable or omit the argument to receive an empty list (`[]`).\n","stderr":"","at":"2026-09-06T00:57:23.711Z"}
