austed.\n\n10. **Naming and dead code.**\n    Clean, descriptive naming matching ticket specification (`get_with_retry`, `client`, `key`, `TransientError`). No unreachable code.\n\n---\n\nGRUMP: APPROVE — cache.py\nFine.\n","stderr":"","at":"2026-09-06T01:03:22.716Z"}
